    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it just feels less like being an outsider and more like i'm just... not actually here. like the scale of everything is so huge and i'm so small that it wouldn't even leave a dent if i vanished. it's almost peaceful thinking about how easy it would be to just stop.",
