    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... the \"making something of it\" part feels so exhausting and pointless when you realize how little it actually changes the math of the world. if everything is just a cycle of people coming and going without leaving a trace, why bother fighting so hard to stay seen? it feels like fighting against the gravity of the whole city.",
